Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:12.09,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:18.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:24.74,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:30.98,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:47.57,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:54.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:01:01.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.49,0:01:06.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:13.56,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.10,0:01:24.50,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:39.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正当我们到处打探奈落的行踪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.34,0:01:41.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路上遇见了三只小猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:44.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这三只猴子又聒噪又冒失
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这些可爱的小猴子正在到处寻找的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.38,0:01:50.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们负责守护的猿神大爷的神体石像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而最后在村子的腌菜缸里面找到了猿神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说出了一段令人惊讶的一段话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.12,0:02:00.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他曾经感觉到一股强烈的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝丑寅方向飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且突然消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.26,0:02:06.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了 那一定是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.63,0:02:08.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丑寅方向… 是指东北方向吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:10.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.47,0:02:14.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下子已经知道接下来该往哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:17.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标是丑寅方向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:24.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第89话 他和他之间的探病大战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.82,0:02:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明早就该上路了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果现在是什么状况啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:37.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:39.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你别那么任性啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:42.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是戈薇自己喜欢感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:44.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点我又不是不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.97,0:02:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的对大家很不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:49.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有耽误到大家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.81,0:02:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正马上又要开始旅行了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家也需要一点时间准备准备呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:54.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:02:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要去打理一些道具才行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:03:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子戈薇这场病来得还真是时候呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:04.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你千万不要放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不赶快把病养好怎么行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:07.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:09.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都知道你很心急
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不要再责怪戈薇了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.66,0:03:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:14.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:21.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又没有责怪她的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:24.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:26.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果戈薇要安心养病的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:28.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好还是避开犬夜叉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:30.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏枫姥姥又不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:31.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真伤脑筋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:35.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧得很厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.19,0:03:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要回家休息几天呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:43.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们那边应该有很好的医生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:45.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说还有各式各样的药呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:46.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:48.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我还是回家休养
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛跟我们这么客气呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:54.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:56.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘 我来背你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:03:58.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:03:59.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在打什么主意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:04.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有啊 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天还要再请一天病假
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:12.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次只是小小的感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.49,0:04:13.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以今天…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.66,0:04:16.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:19.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮戈薇同学今天又请假了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次好像是感冒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:22.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是感冒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.17,0:04:30.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？没胃口吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:32.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么胃口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.24,0:04:34.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 我去煮点热饮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.61,0:04:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你配着药吃下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么久戈薇都没回来过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:43.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么一回来就感冒了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概那边的天气比较冷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看得好好休养几天才可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:54.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小小的感冒也要请假啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:58.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她以前不是老用一些罕见的病请假吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:04:59.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.47,0:05:01.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们说要不要一起去看她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:02.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去探病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.71,0:05:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇这次既然是感冒 应该会在家休息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:06.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要住院吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:07.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久没有见到戈薇了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真的有点想她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:13.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要去日暮同学家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:15.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:17.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说戈薇突然感冒了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:18.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.66,0:05:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感冒了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:21.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:23.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要跟我们一起去… 是吗？得了感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:25.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底要不要跟我们去探病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:26.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪里怪气的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:32.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别乱了方寸 利吉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:36.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇静一点就可以解决
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:37.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实在的 好久都没打过妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:41.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:43.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为犬夜叉他们不在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要加倍努力才行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:52.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快射箭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:57.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你碍到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:06.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.91,0:06:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 是你啊枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:16.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:19.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说 最近有很多妖怪出来作怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:23.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子里面的人 被袭击得怕得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是因为奈落突然躲起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前奈落在这些妖怪都乖乖的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:30.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下还不趁机会出来作乱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.73,0:06:37.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活得不耐烦啦 死妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:50.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.65,0:06:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是特地赶来帮我们的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.09,0:07:00.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他根本没想那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:08.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别挡着我 滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.90,0:07:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 知不知道本大爷是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:14.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管你是谁都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:17.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子今天有事 一定要进这个泥沼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个泥沼已经是我的势力范围了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.78,0:07:23.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再敢罗罗唆唆 我的脑袋会吃掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用脑袋吃掉我是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:31.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有本事吃吃看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.06,0:07:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.01,0:07:53.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个山谷全都是我的势力范围
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.89,0:08:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:11.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个瀑布…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:13.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你聋了是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:24.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪一直都没再出现耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:28.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底躲到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:37.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在那边干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得来了就顺便嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.69,0:08:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们来看我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在发烧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:46.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鼻子跟喉咙觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:47.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一点点咳嗽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你的一点点小意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:53.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算一点小感冒也不能够太大意喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:54.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:57.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得你最近为什么这么常生病呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:00.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 那个他有没有过来看你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:01.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:03.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别装了 那个像太保的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么会来看我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.85,0:09:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.95,0:09:08.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他果然一点也不体贴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.09,0:09:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是这样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:12.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在是什么情况嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:14.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你快点医好它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.06,0:09:17.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他是住远了一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:19.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远了一点是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:20.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:23.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个叫北条同学来看你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.87,0:09:24.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:26.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:27.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:30.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学 你怎么也来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:34.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一听说你感冒就想要来看你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过我一直很烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底我能够为你做些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.39,0:09:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想到可以送你能够帮助恢复健康的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不嫌弃的话 这些是送你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.53,0:09:49.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是可以保佑你身体健康的护身符
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过仔细想想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:58.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还其实这些都出自于你们家神社呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.47,0:09:59.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们家的那些护身符一点用都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:02.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.48,0:10:05.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是哑铃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:07.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你最好多做一点运动锻炼体力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:09.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢…谢谢你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:10.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:12.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先请进来坐再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:27.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:28.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇回家养病啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.03,0:10:29.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:33.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是想在家里应该比较适合养病
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:34.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就叫她回去养病了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛不说一声就这样跑回去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:38.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个浑帐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:39.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害我好不容易…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:40.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.81,0:10:42.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是你把我扔在这里 一个人跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.51,0:10:45.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:48.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:50.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.23,0:10:59.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好好吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:00.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是名产吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.73,0:11:02.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 马上要出远门了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:03.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是准备路上吃的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:12.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明记得收在这里头的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:14.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到啦找到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.35,0:11:19.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是我们日暮家代代相传
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:21.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以治百病的灵丹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算让我找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:25.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 爷爷 有了这瓶药
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信过了不久之后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:30.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇一定可以完全好起来的 算了 管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:32.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小蚋让开 太好了…找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.37,0:11:36.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:39.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:41.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.87,0:11:44.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 闯出大祸了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇好一点了没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:55.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐她一直在睡觉耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在有好多人来看她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:11:59.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:02.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些男生都好大一阵骚动呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.09,0:12:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪亚由美太有魅力了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:06.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说这些了啦 绘理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.73,0:12:08.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们班那些男生好像也常在讨论耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:15.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些臭男生也会在背后说我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:15.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:18.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我想出去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:26.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真的追来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:28.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么追来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:30.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然追到戈薇家来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:32.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来探病的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好体贴哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:35.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么说啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:38.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然他什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:41.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇已经有男朋友的事都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:44.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 听说戈薇的男朋友很体贴呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.94,0:12:45.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:46.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:49.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们现在在说的是我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:50.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.81,0:12:53.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是呢 我们说的是戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:54.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来说好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:57.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 戈薇已经有个在交往的男朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.68,0:12:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 不过连戈薇生病都没来看她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个很过分的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:03.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学校… 大家感觉起来很快乐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.09,0:13:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:09.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太 什么事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:11.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗哥哥来看你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.47,0:13:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.60,0:13:21.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有啊 想看看你现在怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.47,0:13:22.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来探我的病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:26.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫七宝跟珊瑚他们两个紧张兮兮的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:27.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我还有谁能来看你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:30.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:32.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的已经好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:34.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是还有一点点在发烧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全身好像也没什么力气
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:44.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可别以为我是来带你回去的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也认为你应该好好休养
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:49.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在能回家休养最好不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.23,0:13:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊咧 已经走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:57.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:13:59.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.21,0:14:03.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学 你有没有什么烦恼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烦恼？你是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:12.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么特别的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意当你的忠实听众
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.89,0:14:18.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者应该说 我希望…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.43,0:14:22.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管什么事你都可以跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.03,0:14:25.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会尽我最大的努力帮助你的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.90,0:14:28.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以换句话说 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:31.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能够交往的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:33.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会…啊咧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:38.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们猜这题会不会考啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:39.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:47.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天就要学力测验啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.83,0:14:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学力测验？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这次考试结果是升学的参考指标呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,升学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.30,0:14:58.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有来上课的这段期间 有没有学习啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没怎么学习…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:03.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇真受不你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.91,0:15:05.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连明天会不会来上学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呐… 能告诉我出题的范围是什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.71,0:15:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:13.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在生病不会想来考试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然要考了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.59,0:15:22.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:25.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学 你帮帮我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然是有什么烦恼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你帮我恶补好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:35.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撑不撑得住啊这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:38.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都没有休息
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:41.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然科这个部分 它的范围已经很明确了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:44.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要把公式背好就行…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.35,0:15:47.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:49.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可不要死撑哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:51.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续吧 北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:15:58.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先走了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.76,0:16:00.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天真的很谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:02.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:05.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们帮了我这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:06.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.27,0:16:08.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.97,0:16:10.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:11.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.51,0:16:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:19.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:23.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个什么学校考试的 真有那么重要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:24.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.39,0:16:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话又说回来 你感冒又没好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个什么鬼考试管他去的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.03,0:16:31.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为感冒好了要回学校
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不用功的话就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.13,0:16:34.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是先把感冒治好比较要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.03,0:16:36.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两样都同样重要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.83,0:16:39.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我说你现在赶快乖乖上床睡觉嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.30,0:16:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:44.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很想回学校嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:48.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点出去啦 不要妨碍我学习
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:49.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.51,0:16:52.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:16:59.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.83,0:17:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 现在觉得怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈煮了一点稀饭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吃一点好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:12.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每样看起来都好好吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:13.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个拿到外面去卖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:15.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该可以赚不少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我劝你们两个最好不要乱碰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.34,0:17:21.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:26.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都没拿 什么都没碰过哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.85,0:17:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:32.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 头痛死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥你不是走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.41,0:17:54.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想借用一下你们家的炉灶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炉灶？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:56.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用瓦斯炉行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:06.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要补充营养就得靠 肝脏 肝脏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狮子肝 鲤鱼肝 鸡肝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上做药引用的草还有树根
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.93,0:18:16.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬哥哥 你要吃这些东西哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:17.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.37,0:18:19.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:20.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:30.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:33.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呐 这是药
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.65,0:18:34.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点喝下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:35.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,药？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好臭哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝下去包管你百病全消
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.94,0:18:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么感冒一定马上就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.68,0:18:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真难喝…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忍耐一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:18:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,味道不是很好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是保证功效如神喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:18:59.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个药是你自己熬的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.19,0:19:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要能够治得好病
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种怪味道我还能够忍受啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:08.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这个药真的有用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:09.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.97,0:19:14.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咿 咿…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:19.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.91,0:19:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐把肝脏汤喝下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.68,0:19:27.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肝脏汤…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶 好像真的有效
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没骗你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.52,0:19:36.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没…没什么大不了的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.22,0:19:40.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你居然还知道这种配药处方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前我老妈教的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.46,0:19:45.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈做给你吃过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 材料有点不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老妈用的 是放了很久的干货
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.21,0:19:54.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用的是生鲜的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:56.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生鲜的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.14,0:19:58.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生鲜的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:19:59.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生鲜的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:04.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总…总之效果很棒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:06.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跟你说不需要那么客气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚对不起哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.59,0:20:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说没关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:13.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也赶快睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你念的是不是什么咒语啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是很久以前我老妈教我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.77,0:20:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:52.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去上学了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:57.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.07,0:20:59.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.11,0:21:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全身都舒服多了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你的药很有效喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:05.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就跟你说过会有效的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.11,0:21:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然好多了 那我就可以去上学了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算要考试我也不怕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.09,0:21:15.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨了 完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:17.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候出门一定会迟到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.83,0:21:20.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕连考试都赶不上了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:23.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点走 一定来得及
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.90,0:21:25.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你叫我快一点也…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.33,0:21:27.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去换衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:32.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.34,0:21:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:36.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是想要赶上考试的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:44.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家早
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.39,0:21:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:47.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感冒已经好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.62,0:21:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好的睡了一觉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在好像全都好了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:52.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试准备得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.13,0:21:54.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我尽全力就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:55.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是要这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.06,0:21:56.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起立
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:19.84,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.39,0:22:29.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:38.90,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.21,0:22:48.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:53.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:58.65,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.93,0:23:06.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.13,0:23:12.40,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.71,0:23:16.94,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.44,0:23:24.18,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.75,0:23:34.18,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.48,0:23:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 狗哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.12,0:23:52.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问你一个男人之间的重大秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.49,0:23:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秘密？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.45,0:23:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么是恋爱 噗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.92,0:23:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱就是永远吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.19,0:23:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛无缘无故问我这个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:24:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我偷偷喜欢上小瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.76,0:24:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 这件事让你去解决
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.53,0:24:03.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.73,0:24:05.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了这个可爱的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.26,0:24:06.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么样都会想出办法来的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.23,0:24:09.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.63,0:24:11.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太大胆的爱情告白
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.77,0:24:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个问题 简直比打妖怪还要棘手嘛
